The self-host compose bundle runs, unmodified and as separate containers:
RustFS (Apache License 2.0), PostgreSQL with pgvector (PostgreSQL License),
Valkey (BSD 3-Clause License). The media image includes an LGPL build of FFmpeg
(GNU LGPL 2.1+, https://ffmpeg.org), run as a separate process. The optional
observability profile runs the OpenTelemetry Collector Contrib, Jaeger and
Prometheus (all Apache License 2.0), unmodified.

Models (downloaded at build time, pinned by SHA-256; see brain/src/senseplane_brain/models.py):
- YOLOX (yolox_s / yolox_tiny ONNX), Copyright (c) 2021-2022 Megvii Inc., Apache License 2.0,
  https://github.com/Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX. yolox_s_int8 is quantized from yolox_s at build
  time with ONNX (Apache 2.0) and SymPy (BSD), calibrated on 100 COCO val2017 photos that are
  downloaded for that step only and not distributed (brain/src/senseplane_brain/quantize.py).
- YAMNet (TFLite) and its AudioSet class map, Copyright Google LLC, Apache License 2.0,
  https://github.com/tensorflow/models/tree/master/research/audioset/yamnet
The brain also uses ONNX Runtime (MIT), LiteRT / ai-edge-litert (Apache 2.0),
OpenCV (Apache 2.0, bundles an LGPL FFmpeg), NumPy (BSD), redis-py (MIT).

